ompanions, and his friends act as gunners who fight alongside him, each with unique abilities.\n\nThe journey leads through monster-filled ruins with secrets and unexpected encounters. Owlboy's pixel art is a highlight, drawn with a great deal of detail, and flight is blended with platforming and combat. A single-player game with full controller support, it suits players who love retro-style visuals and emotional storytelling."}}